  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="08-01-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised Atlabase ID's in 11 and 15 DMX modes to use 'LoFF=on' version.  Added ID's to 13 DMX modes." />
  <History Date="08-01-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised conditionals.  Added function index.  Increased wheel resolution.  Added macros." />
